- Apply these commands globally under BGP configuration. For neighbor or group-specific adjustments, repeat the `add-paths` configuration within the relevant group or neighbor context.
- This configuration ensures labeled IPv6 routes are advertised with MPLS labels for seamless MPLS transport.
