- BGP `family ipv4` configuration operates independently of OSPF and will not disrupt existing adjacencies  
- Route policies must filter/provider-specific routes to prevent unintended advertisement of OSPF-learned routes  
- Verify OSPF stability with `show router ospf neighbor` post-configuration  

