To prevent iBGP-learned routes from being reflected back to their originators, configure the `disable-client-reflect` command at the relevant BGP group or neighbor level. Here are the CLI commands:

**Apply to a specific neighbor:**
```
configure router bgp
    group "IBGP_GROUP"
        neighbor 192.0.2.1
            disable-client-reflect
        exit
    exit
exit
```

**Apply to an entire group:**
```
configure router bgp
    group "IBGP_GROUP"
        disable-client-reflect
    exit
exit
```

